  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Poseidon president Ikezawa brings Muranishi and Toshi to an upscale jazz lounge run by Reika. As live music fills the room, Muranishi admires how freely the band plays, and Ikezawa replies with a pointed lesson about unspoken rules and order. Listen first to the contrast between Reika's velvet club hospitality and Ikezawa's gravelly boss talk.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "よう、ママ、久しぶり。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "いらっしゃいませ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "こちらでございます、どうぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "まあ、飲んで。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "麗華です。どうぞごひいきに。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "この店、任せたんだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "気に入ったかな？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "皆さん、自由に演奏してて楽しそうです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "ジャズのセッションってのは自由にやってるように見える。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "でもな、暗黙の決まり事があるんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "そうなんですね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "自由と秩序のバランスがいいからなんだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "池沢さん、そろそろ要件を聞きたいですね。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "よう、ママ、久しぶり。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hey, Mama-san, long time no see.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "いらっしゃいませ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Welcome.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "こちらでございます、どうぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Right this way, please.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "まあ、飲んで。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Come on, have a drink.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "どうぞごひいきに。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you for your patronage.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "気に入ったかな？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you like it here?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "皆さん、自由に演奏してて楽しそうです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Everyone is playing freely and looks like they are having fun.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "でもな、暗黙の決まり事があるんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Still, there are unspoken rules.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "そうなんですね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Is that so?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "自由と秩序のバランスがいいからなんだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It is because the balance between freedom and order is so good.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "池沢さん、そろそろ要件を聞きたいですね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr. Ikezawa, I would like to hear your main point soon.'",
      "gap": 0.65
